  "description": "This Building Block proposes a schema representation of the OpenEO process [`constant`](https://processes.openeo.org/#constant) \u2014 *Define a constant value*. It models the `arguments` object of a process graph node invoking `constant`. This is a proposed correspondence between the OpenEO process definition and an OGC Building Block schema, not a settled equivalence.\n\nDefines a constant value that can be reused in multiple places of a process.\n\n## Source\n\nOpenEO Processes specification: [`constant`](https://processes.openeo.org/#constant) ([openeo-processes/constant.json at 2.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/Open-EO/openeo-processes/blob/2.0.0-rc.2/constant.json)).\n",
